* CABSRT13 - EDI INTERCHANGE FILTER
* MVT OS/360 SORT/MERGE FORM OF JCL/CTLCARDS/CABSRT13.
* SELECTS THE SEGMENTS THAT BELONG TO TONIGHT'S INTERCHANGE.
* CABFMT06 WRITES SEGMENTS FOR EVERY CARRIER AND HAS NO IDEA THAT
* MOST OF THEM ARE DISCARDED IN THIS STEP.
*
* THE KEY ON THIS CARD IS NEW
*   THE ORIGINAL CARD ASKED FOR A COPY AND NAMED NO KEY AT ALL.
*   THIS SORT HAS NO COPY MODE, SO THE CARD CARRIES A REAL KEY OF
*   PARTNER CODE AT 9 FOLLOWED BY SEGMENT ID AND SEQUENCE AT 1.
*   THE OUTPUT IS THEREFORE NO LONGER IN INPUT ORDER - IT IS IN
*   PARTNER ORDER, AND WITHIN A PARTNER IN SEGMENT ID AND
*   SEQUENCE ORDER.
*
* THE RULE THAT LEFT THIS CARD
*   THE INCLUDE CONDITION LISTING THE FOUR TRADING PARTNER CODES
*   AT BYTE 9 IS NOT CODED HERE.  THIS SORT HAS NO INCLUDE
*   STATEMENT.  THE E15 EXIT CABSXEDI NOW HOLDS THE PARTNER LIST
*   AS AN OCCURS TABLE OF LITERALS IN ITS OWN SOURCE.
*   WHEN A NEW PARTNER GOES LIVE, CABSXEDI IS RECOMPILED AND
*   RELINKED - THERE IS NOTHING ON THIS CARD TO CHANGE.  WHEN A
*   PARTNER IS REMOVED AND THAT SOURCE CHANGE IS NOT MADE, THEIR
*   SEGMENTS GO OUT ANYWAY.
*
* WHICH PARTNERS ARE IN TONIGHT'S INTERCHANGE IS NO LONGER
* READABLE FROM THIS CONTROL CARD.
 SORT FIELDS=(9,4,CH,A,1,8,CH,A)
 RECORD TYPE=F,LENGTH=(200)
 MODS E15=(CABSXEDI,4096,SORTEXIT,N)
 END
